  - "prisma/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Backend Core

Stack: NestJS, TypeScript, Prisma ORM, Postgresql, Yarn.

Use simple NestJS modular architecture:

Controller → Service → PrismaService

Do not use Clean Architecture, CQRS, repository layer, event bus, microservices, TypeORM, Sequelize, npm, pnpm, bun.

Generate only what was requested. Do not create base services, base controllers, abstract modules, or future-proof infrastructure.
